{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/archive/component/aspace_957998570bd6df0c6cf18623cf80a07a","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"aspace_957998570bd6df0c6cf18623cf80a07a","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Maria Chabot correspondence regarding Irene Zelinski","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"EAD Legal status statement","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/userestrict"}],"content":null,"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"abstract","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/abstract"}],"content":"Of the eight letters concerning Zelinski, three are letters from Maria Chabot to Edward Chrichton concerning a debt, Sept. 12 – Oct. 5, 1964; four are letters from Chabot to Georgeanna Wight, of which three concern the break in Chabot's relationship to Zelinski, July 21-29, 1961, and one concerns Wight's application to enter a nursing home, Jan. 22, 1962; and one letter from Wight to Chabot concerning the break in the Chabot/Zelinski relationship and a transcription of it.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"EAD Related Material","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/relatedmaterial"}],"content":[],"type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}